        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.1;">4.280 <span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-green);">KK</span></div>
      <div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
